    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape from creepy and irrational enemies. Fight your fear! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a boy who steps into an alleyway. Gradually you notice something strange about this place. Escape from the monsters and reach the truth...!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Individualized fear situations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters attacking you in different ways, can you handle it?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620600/extras/bbd3df7e839994e36ce018a9c3013246.poster.avif?t=1746913621\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620600/extras/bbd3df7e839994e36ce018a9c3013246.webm?t=1746913621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620600/extras/bbd3df7e839994e36ce018a9c3013246.mp4?t=1746913621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>Diverse level design and fast-paced development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The speedy experience will keep you on your toes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620600/extras/1ae5a1304c8ee3a67015431193f666e8.poster.avif?t=1746913621\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620600/extras/1ae5a1304c8ee3a67015431193f666e8.webm?t=1746913621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620600/extras/1ae5a1304c8ee3a67015431193f666e8.mp4?t=1746913621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collector elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three items in this work, and if you collect them, there may be something..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620600/extras/f02fabf04dfc0ef5aeb3cbb2926edfe6.avif?t=1746913621\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Option</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volume, camera sensitivity, rendering settings, language (Japanese, English)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Distribution Guidelines</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distribution is possible for both individuals and corporations without permission.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is only possible when using the functionality provided by the video distribution site.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include the name of the game in the title of your video or streaming video, or include a link to the Steam page in the summary.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I'm not responsible for any damages caused by the distribution of this game video.</strong>*Complete reset of saved data can be done by simultaneously pressing N, A, T, M, and I so that N is pressed last at the title screen.</p>",
